Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(app): copy error details from mutation error toasts

Mutation error toasts offer Copy details, which copies the title, message,
operation, HTTP status, server code and body, page and caller context as JSON.
Queued-message sends include the thread, queued message, mode and wait.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
